# Default home for test-run artifacts (screenshots, frames logs, perf JSON).
# Tracked tests/*-shots/ and tests/e2e_*.frames.log are frozen evidence and
# are only written by an explicit evidence run (EVIDENCE=1 / OUT_DIR=...).
